Look for the skill file `/cli-script-writing` if the task is related to writing up new scripts, regardless of what language it is.

# No Flag Spam in Scripts

**Never add CLI flags or options that weren't explicitly requested.** Every flag you add must be justified by the caller's actual need — not by an imagined future convenience.

## The test

> If removing this flag would make the code shorter and clearer, it shouldn't exist.
